<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<Mod id="d7b3423c-8f4c-4253-992e-71e2419c53a6" version="6">
  <Properties>
    <Name>卡提希娅—启明之国 v1.0</Name>
    <Stability>Beta</Stability>
    <Teaser>[COLOR_CYAN]以智慧启明，以力量守护。开局获得双形态圣女，阵亡十回合后归来。[ENDCOLOR]</Teaser>
    <Description>《文明5：美丽新世界》Super Power 子模组。双形态英雄、城市辅政、时代成长与定向裁决；v1.0更新人物圆形头像、开场画面、地图、技能图标、原生音乐和十回合复活。适用于 CIV5MPDLL 62 / Super Power 10FF 单人游戏。</Description>
    <Authors>hunxi</Authors>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <AffectsSavedGames>1</AffectsSavedGames>
    <MinCompatibleSaveVersion>0</MinCompatibleSaveVersion>
    <SupportsSinglePlayer>1</SupportsSinglePlayer>
    <SupportsMultiplayer>0</SupportsMultiplayer>
